{
  "name": "Create daily webpage PDF reports with PDFBolt, Slack, and Google Drive",
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "pdf"
    },
    {
      "name": "url"
    },
    {
      "name": "webpage"
    },
    {
      "name": "slack"
    },
    {
      "name": "google-drive"
    },
    {
      "name": "automation"
    },
    {
      "name": "pdfbolt"
    },
    {
      "name": "report"
    },
    {
      "name": "schedule"
    }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "name": "Workflow overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3056,
        1040
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 356,
        "content": "## Create Daily Webpage PDF Reports With PDFBolt\n\nThis workflow runs on a daily schedule, prepares report metadata, converts a webpage URL to PDF with PDFBolt, posts the PDF to Slack, and archives the same file in Google Drive.\n\n### Setup\nAdd your PDFBolt API key from https://app.pdfbolt.com/api-keys, connect Slack, and connect Google Drive. In the Code node, replace the sample URL and report name. In Slack, choose the channel where the PDF should be posted. In Google Drive, choose the folder where reports should be archived."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "Report settings note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3712,
        1056
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 360,
        "height": 188,
        "content": "## Prepare Report Settings\n\nThe Code node keeps the workflow easy to reuse. Set the webpage URL, report name, Slack message, and dated PDF filename in one place before PDFBolt generates the file."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "URL rendering note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3840,
        1472
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 376,
        "height": 236,
        "content": "## Render The Webpage\n\nUse a URL that PDFBolt can reach. Public pages work out of the box. For protected pages, add HTTP Credentials, Cookies, or Extra HTTP Headers in the PDFBolt node's Additional Options. Use `Network Idle` for pages that load charts, images, or async data."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "Delivery note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        4128,
        944
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 400,
        "height": 188,
        "content": "## Send And Archive\n\nPDFBolt returns the generated PDF as binary field `data`. Slack uploads that file to the selected channel, and Google Drive stores the same binary field for later reference."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "Daily schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        3632,
        1280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.3
    },
    {
      "name": "Prepare report settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        3840,
        1280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const reportDate = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);\n\nconst reportName = 'Daily webpage report';\nconst reportUrl = 'https://example.com';\nconst filename = `daily-webpage-report-${reportDate}.pdf`;\n\nreturn [{\n    json: {\n        reportDate,\n        reportName,\n        reportUrl,\n        filename,\n        slackTitle: `${reportName} - ${reportDate}`,\n        slackMessage: `Daily webpage PDF report generated with PDFBolt for ${reportUrl}.`,\n    },\n}];"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "name": "Generate webpage PDF with PDFBolt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-pdfbolt.pdfBolt",
      "position": [
        4048,
        1280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.reportUrl }}",
        "operation": "convertUrl",
        "endpointType": "direct",
        "additionalOptions": {
          "format": "A4",
          "filename": "={{ $json.filename }}",
          "waitUntil": "networkidle",
          "printBackground": true
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "Send PDF to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "position": [
        4272,
        1168
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "title": "={{ $('Prepare report settings').item.json.slackTitle }}",
          "fileName": "={{ $('Prepare report settings').item.json.filename }}",
          "channelId": "PASTE_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID_HERE",
          "initialComment": "={{ $('Prepare report settings').item.json.slackMessage }}"
        },
        "resource": "file",
        "authentication": "oAuth2"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.5
    },
    {
      "name": "Archive PDF in Google Drive",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "position": [
        4272,
        1392
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "name": "={{ $('Prepare report settings').item.json.filename }}",
        "driveId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "My Drive",
          "cachedResultUrl": "https://drive.google.com/drive/my-drive",
          "cachedResultName": "My Drive"
        },
        "options": {},
        "folderId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "root",
          "cachedResultUrl": "https://drive.google.com/drive",
          "cachedResultName": "/ (Root folder)"
        },
        "inputDataFieldName": "data"
      },
      "typeVersion": 3
    }
  ],
  "active": false,
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "binaryMode": "separate",
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "connections": {
    "Daily schedule": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Prepare report settings",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Prepare report settings": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Generate webpage PDF with PDFBolt",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Generate webpage PDF with PDFBolt": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send PDF to Slack",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Archive PDF in Google Drive",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "meta": {
